OL,3,GNEWSAExtradition of former teacher
OL,4,Aaccused of child sex abuse delayed
OL,5,Aagain
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe extradition of a former teacher
OL,8,Faccused of historical sex abuse charges
OL,9,Fin Scotland has been delayed again.
OL,11,FIain Wares, 87, faces about 90 charges
OL,12,Fof abusing former pupils of Edinburgh
OL,13,FAcademy and Fettes College, where he
OL,14,Ftaught in the 1960s and 1970s.
OL,16,FWares now lives in Cape Town in South
OL,17,FAfrica, where he was arrested on a UK
OL,18,Fextradition warrant in October last
OL,19,Fyear before being released on bail.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
