OL,3,GNEWSAExtradition of former teacher
OL,4,Aaccused of child sex abuse delayed
OL,5,Aagain
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn extradition hearing was cancelled
OL,8,Fearlier this year due to sickness and
OL,9,Fhad been rescheduled for Tuesday, but
OL,10,Fit has now been delayed again until 10
OL,11,FNovember.
